OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, President Botha of South Africa has
OL,6, said he will return to office in about
OL,7, a month's time.
OL,9,FMr Botha, 73, who recently had a slight
OL,10,Fstroke, made the announcement after a
OL,11,Fshort visit to his office in Cape Town.
OL,13,FHe said he would attend to matters of
OL,14,Fstate as well as possible election
OL,15,Fdates on his return.
OL,17,FEarlier today, the ruling National
OL,18,FParty's new leader Mr FW de Klerk
OL,19,Fcalled for a new peace initiative with
OL,20,Fblack leaders and said that things
OL,21,Fwould have to change drastically.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
