OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, French police say they have found the
OL,6, body of one of the three British
OL,7, climbers missing in the Alps.
OL,9,FThey say the body was found on the
OL,10,FItalian side of the Mont Blanc range.
OL,12,FThe search for the two other missing
OL,13,FBritons and a West German will be
OL,14,Fresumed tomorrow.
OL,16,FThe British climbers are from Bristol
OL,17,Fand Wiltshire. The party went missing
OL,18,Fa week ago.
OL,19,F
OL,20,F
OL,21,F
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
